      "primaryAttributeStat": 348,
      "primaryAttribute": "Attack",
      "secondaryAttribute": "Crit Rate",
      "secondaryAttributeStat": "25%",
      "trait": "<p>If AoE damage is dealt, apply <span style=\"color: rgb(243, 109, 28);\">1</span> debuff for <span style=\"color: rgb(243, 109, 28);\">1</span> turn. If the target has <span style=\"color: rgb(243, 109, 28);\">3</span> or more debuffs, this attack ignores <span style=\"color: rgb(243, 109, 28);\">15%</span> of their Cover damage reduction.</p>",
      "effect": "<p>Each time an attack successfully hits <span style=\"color: rgb(243, 109, 28);\">3/3/3/3/2/2 targets</span>, the damage of the next active skill is increased by <span style=\"color: rgb(243, 109, 28);\">10%/15%/20%/20%/20%/20%</span>, with an additional increase of <span style=\"color: rgb(243, 109, 28);\">10%/10%/10%/15%/20%/20%</span> damage for AoE skills. After dealing damage, there is a <span style=\"color: rgb(243, 109, 28);\">20%/36%/54%/68%/84%/100%</span> chance to apply <span style=\"color: rgb(243, 109, 28);\">1/1/1/1/1/2</span> debuff(s) to the target.</p>",
      "imprintDescription": "<p>Increase damage dealt to Varjagers by <span style=\"color: rgb(243, 109, 28);\">2.5%</span><span>. If using a basic skill, increase the damage by an additional </span><span style=\"color: rgb(243, 109, 28);\">2.5%</span><span>.</span></p>",
